# Preserve audio pitch when changing Media Source playback speed.
#
# Time-stretches decoded audio with an FFmpeg atempo chain instead of playing
# it back at a scaled sample rate, so the pitch stays put at any speed.
#
# Source:  https://github.com/jonata/obs-studio/tree/feat/preserve-audio-pitch
# Applies to: obs-studio 32.2.1 (the tag fetch_libs.py pins)
# Touches:  shared/media-playback/ only, which is compiled into obs-ffmpeg.
#
